From 99923ee225b6123cb0e0c239bd2d00afb1083d2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:08:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Generic cam decoder with detection window and tooth count
 check (pro-style)

New vvtMode "Generic window": a cam with any number of teeth syncs only on the
tooth inside a configurable crank-degree window, and can refuse sync when the
teeth counted per cam turn do not match.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
